---
import Crest from './Crest.astro';
import { school } from '../data/school';

const navLinks = [
  { href: '/about/', label: '学校简介' },
  { href: '/campus/', label: '校园风光' },
  { href: '/news/', label: '校园动态' },
  { href: '/admissions/', label: '招生信息' },
  { href: '/contact/', label: '联系我们' },
];

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="footer-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="footer-brand">
          <Crest size={54} />
          <div>
            <p class="name">{school.name}</p>
            <p class="motto">{school.motto}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="margin-top:18px;max-width:34ch;font-size:12.5px;color:rgba(247,242,232,.55)">
          本站为非官方校园信息整理站点，用于前端学习与内容归档；学校信息以官方发布为准。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <h4>浏览</h4>
        <ul>
          {navLinks.map((link) => (
            <li><a href={link.href}>{link.label}</a></li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <h4>地址</h4>
        <ul>
          <li>{school.address}</li>
          <li>坐标 {school.coords.lng}, {school.coords.lat}</li>
          <li><a href="https://map.baidu.com/search/%E5%9B%BA%E5%A7%8B%E5%8E%BF%E6%B0%B8%E5%92%8C%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A6" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">在百度地图中查看 ↗</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-note">
      <span>© {year} 永和高中资料站 · 仅供学习交流</span>
      <span>
        本站域名：永和高中.love
        <button class="copy-link" type="button" data-copy="https://永和高中.love">
          复制本站地址
        </button>
      </span>
      <span>资料整理自：百度百科、学校官方抖音账号公开内容</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
